    "type": "heading",
    "text": "Deploying the Sample To deploy this sample in your environment: 1. Open the template design ap_bookmark.IFD in Output Designer and recompile the template for the appropriate presentment target. 2. Modify the -z option in the ^job command in the data file ap_bookmark.dat to: \u2022 Identify the target output device. \u2022 Identify the bookmark file using the -abmk command. \u2022 Identify the section for which to generate bookmarks, if desired, using the -abms command. For example,",
