    "text": "To bookmark by \u2026 Use the command line parameter \u2026 -abmk ap_bookmark.bmk -abms invoices Invoices -abmk ap_bookmark.bmk -abms type Type -abmk ap_bookmark.bmk -abms amount Amount",
